  "body": "This is an umbrella issue to aggregate other issues to update and modernize 2D API described [here](https://github.com/fserb/canvas2D).\r\n\r\n- [x] [Canvas context loss](https://github.com/whatwg/html/issues/4809)\r\n- [x] [Conic gradient](https://github.com/whatwg/html/issues/5431)\r\n- [x] [willReadFrequently](https://github.com/whatwg/html/issues/5614)\r\n- [x] [Array color input](https://github.com/whatwg/html/issues/5616)\r\n- [x] [Text modifiers](https://github.com/whatwg/html/issues/5617)\r\n- [x] [Reset function](https://github.com/whatwg/html/issues/5618)\r\n- [x] [RoundRect](https://github.com/whatwg/html/issues/5619)\r\n- [ ] [Perspective transforms](https://github.com/whatwg/html/issues/5620)\r\n- [ ] [Modern filters](https://github.com/whatwg/html/issues/5621)\r\n\r\n\r\n(cc @whatwg/canvas )\r\n",
